2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-iAKWXU kOzfyS pf-94_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-96_">our executive team</span></h2><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-dPiLbb dYuGJX pf-97_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/pf-aeafaf78--waveborder.svg?v=1617182245" loading="lazy" width="106" height="8"/></div><div data-pf-type="Custom.HTML" class="sc-efQSVx kdrjec pf-98_"><div class="paut__member-info-slider">
  <div class="paut__member-info-cell">
	 <div class="paut__member-name">Valerie Ells</div>
	 <div class="paut__member-position">Chief Financial Officer</div>
	 <div class="paut__member-content">Valerie has been with Laird Superfood since April  2019 She lives on Original Instafuel and is embarrassed just how quickly she can go through a bag. A fun fact about Valerie not many people know is she loves to grow food with her family. She says right after the New Year her kids start begging her to start seeds. Valerie is a runner and says there is “nothing better than disappearing deep into the mountains, powered by your own two feet.” Valerie is motivated by making a difference. “No matter the project, if I have the opportunity to make a positive impact or create a positive change, nothing will stop me from making it happen,” Valerie says.</div>
   </div>
  
   <div class="paut__member-info-cell">
	 <div class="paut__member-name">Dawn Bernhardt</div>
	 <div class="paut__member-position">Chief Human Resource Officer</div>
	 <div class="paut__member-content">Dawn started working with Laird Superfood in March 2019. She is a self-described “OG fan all the way” and can't have coffee without Original Superfood Creamer anymore. She also uses Hydrate Original in her family’s smoothies daily. Many people are surprised to find out Dawn lives in a straw-bale home off-the-grid and that her secret talent is cooking. Dawn is motivated by teammates. “I was always involved in team sports in my youth, and being on a team with people who are better than you is always where I want to be - which is why I love my job at Laird Superfood! Our team is incredible and gets better every day,” Dawn says.</div>
   </div>


   <div class="paut__member-info-cell">
	 <div class="paut__member-name">Scott Mcguire</div>
	 <div class="paut__member-position">Chief Operating Officer</div>
	 <div class="paut__member-content">Scott has been with Laird Superfood since November 2020. His favorite Laird Superfood product is easily Orange Guava Hydrate because “it does what it says and tastes great.” Scott says one of his secret talents is that he can spin a pillow on his finger forever BUT only with his left hand. Scott is motivated by his amazing wife and kids. At work he’s motivated by winning with a great team of incredible people. His favorite place he’s ever been to is central Oregon...so he and his family moved there.</div>
   </div>

</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-2dab" data-pf-type="Section" id="sustaina-section-wrap" class="sc-eFegNN kRTGhu pf-99_"><div style="--cw:1250px" class="sc-jWUzzU jXgGHC"><div class="sc-iJKOTD qriss pf-100_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jHkVzv dZEEUA pf-101_"><div class="sc-iJKOTD qriss pf-102_ sustainability-section-wrap pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:10px;--s-sm:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jHkVzv dZEEUA pf-103_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-iAKWXU kOzfyS pf-104_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-106_">Our Commitment to Sustainability<br></span></h2><p class="sc-htJRVC jYbLmW pf-107_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-109_">At Laird Superfood we are constantly and continuously working to be more sustainable. <br><br>When we first set out to build our headquarters, we wanted to choose a location that would impact the local economy in a positive way and make sure our company was mindful of its carbon footprint. We couldn’t be happier to be located in Sisters, OR.<br><br>We embrace the safe and ethical sourcing of our materials. This means that all suppliers must pass a rigorous evaluation of their processes prior to working with us.<br></span></p><a href="/pages/sustainability" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-kDTinF jnvufR pf-110_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-112_">learn more</span></a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jHkVzv dZEEUA pf-113_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-dPiLbb dYuGJX pf-114_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1308/3049/t/78/assets/pf-e4ec75f3--AboutUsTileimage2_1200x.png?v=1617184880" srcSet="https://cdn.sho