	<p class="team-member-bio-wrap">
		I've always said what you put in your body, affects how you feel, how you act, and how you think. This has been realized time and time again during my tenure here at Laird Superfood.  To be excited to come to work simply to enjoy the "fruits" of your labor, is an awesome perk of any job. Especially when my coworkers and management constantly support and encourage me, while valuing my input. Not only do I work for a company that promotes and creates products encouraging healthy living; but I get to be a part of the progression of the company's development.  As I've grown with Laird, my excitement continues as we develop our product line and processes further.
