le="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-gKclnd dMSgnu pf-218_"><p class="sc-htJRVC jYbLmW pf-219_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-221_"><div>Laird Superfood all started when big wave-surfer Laird Hamilton shared his functional coffee with friend Paul Hodge. After Paul tried this special blend he knew Laird’s incredible coffee recipe needed to be made available to everyone. Laird Superfood started and launched its first product, Original Superfood Creamer, in 2015.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Laird started experimenting with his morning ritual almost two decades ago. He found that when he started adding fats to his morning cup, like coconut oil, he had amazing energy throughout the rest of his day. He gradually perfected his recipe for an epic cup of fuel and began sharing it with his friends in the surf community.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>“I love tinkering and I ultimately created a high-fat coffee recipe to help me prep for the best day possible out on the waves. After that, I started to offer my secret coffee recipe to friends and family, and before I knew it, it became a pre-training and pre-surfing tradition. We are so excited to go from sharing these products around the kitchen table to sharing them with everyone. That’s really what Laird Superfood is all about; the spirit of Aloha (sharing), and Ohana (family). Our mantra is Better Food. Better You, and it’s our mission to offer high-quality products with plant-based ingredients to help elevate and optimize everyone’s daily routine, from morning coffee to afternoon hydration. It has since grown to encompass a wide range of products beyond our Superfood Creamers, including Organic Coffee, Coconut Water, Instant Coffee, and more,” said Co-Founder Laird Hamilton.</div><div><br></div></span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-furwcr dAWGlU pf-222_"><button type="button" class="sc-jRQBWg fpohrn pf-223_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="31bca8a7-5dfd-49a2-b016-4d805df616cd" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Why Central Oregon?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="31bca8a7-5dfd-49a2-b016-4d805df616cd" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-gKclnd dMSgnu pf-225_"><p class="sc-htJRVC jYbLmW pf-226_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-228_"><div>Co-Founders Laird Hamilton and Paul Hodge fell in love with Central Oregon for the abundance of opportunities it has to offer. From the start, Laird and Paul knew they wanted everything done in-house and in one location, to ensure quality and consistency. After building a thorough team and securing two warehouses and a production facility in Sisters, Oregon, the Laird Superfood company was established as one of the largest employers in the region.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>When we first set out to build our headquarters, we wanted to choose a location that would impact the local economy in a positive way and make sure our company was mindful of its carbon footprint. We couldn’t be happier to be located in Sisters, OR.</div></span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-furwcr dAWGlU pf-229_"><button type="button" class="sc-jRQBWg fpohrn pf-230_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="5dfda9a2-7016-4d80-9df6-16cdf65e6f4a" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span><div>Is Laird Hamilton actually involved in the brand?</div></span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="5dfda9a2-7016-4d80-9df6-16cdf65e6f4a" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-gKclnd dMSgnu pf-232_"><p class="sc-htJRVC jYbLmW pf-233_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-235_"><div>Yes! Laird Superfood truly started in Laird Hamilton’s kitchen. Laird is not only a Co-Founder, he also serves as a Director and Chief Innovator. He is integral in the curation of all of our products and launches.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>“What makes our products unique is our commitment to sourcing the best ingredients. Gabby and I are involved with the product innovation process from day one until the product is available on our website. We only use ingredients that we feel comfortable consuming daily, which sometimes means it takes us a long time to finalize a product,” said co-founder Laird Hamilton.&nbsp;</div></span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-furwcr dAWGlU pf-236_"><button type="button" class="sc-jRQBWg fpohrn pf-237_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="f65e6f4a-1ccb-4366-950f-efbb7990162c" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Where do you source ingredients from?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="f65e6f4a-1ccb-4366-950f-efbb7990162c" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-gKclnd dMSgnu pf-239_"><p class="sc-htJRVC jYbLmW pf-240_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-242_">We source our high-quality plant-based ingredients globally and put an emphasis on US sources whenever possible. We aim to source responsibly and sustainably and believe that the foods you consume should be as good for the earth as they are for you.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-furwcr dAWGlU pf-243_"><button type="button" class="sc-jRQBWg fpohrn pf-244_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="1ccbc366-d50f-4fbb-b990-162cef0af3ec" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span><div>Is your packaging recyclable or compostable? </div></span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="1ccbc366-d50f-4fbb-b990-162cef0af3ec" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-gKclnd dMSgnu pf-246_"><p class="sc-htJRVC jYbLmW pf-247_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kTLmzF bGBrSp pf-249_"><div>We emphasize sustainability and social responsibility in all of our product choices. We are consistently making strides to improve our packaging and carbon footprint.<br><br></div><div>At Laird Superfood, we are committed to the consistency and quality of the products we produce. We believe that food should enable you to perform at the highest level, no matter what you're doing. We promise to deliver on these values with every product we create, every day.&nbsp;</div></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
